# Images install their own dependencies and build their own output. Host copies
# collide with them (pnpm symlinks cannot overwrite the image's directories) and
# must never carry local secrets into a build context.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report*
**/.lighthouseci
.git
.playwright-mcp
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
